<h2><a name='resources' class='resources'></a>Resources</h2>
<p>
This is for standalone resources. See <a href='#research'>Research</a> for code and data from concrete studies. Please get in touch if you encounter any issue.
</p>

<p>
<ul>
  <li style="font-size: 19px;">
    <a href='https://avarlab.upf.edu/' target='_blank'>AvarLab (https://avarlab.upf.edu/)</a> is an open-source platform for <a href='https://glottolog.org/resource/languoid/id/avar1256' target='_blank'>Avar (avar1256)</a>, including a dictionary, a corpus, and NLP tools.
  </li>
</ul>
</p>
